# PLACEHOLDER - This file must be replaced with a real age-encrypted SSH private key.
#
# This private key is used by suzaku's nix-copy user to authenticate to minamo's
# nix-copy-suzaku user when pulling pre-built store paths.
#
# To create the real secret:
#   1. On suzaku (or locally), generate the key pair:
#      ssh-keygen -t ed25519 -f /tmp/nix-copy-suzaku -N "" -C "nix-copy@suzaku"
#   2. Copy the public key to secrets/nix-copy-suzaku.pub in this repo.
#   3. Encrypt the private key with agenix (add suzaku's SSH host key as a recipient
#      in your agenix secrets configuration), then run:
#      agenix -e secrets/nix-copy-suzaku.id_ed25519.age
